      "content": "Since the chair is used specifically for your freelance design business, it generally qualifies as a business expense. You can usually deduct the cost by categorizing it under \"Office Furniture\" or \"Equipment\" in QuickBooks. You might need to depreciate the cost over several years, though some small businesses can expense the entire cost in one year. Consulting your tax professional will confirm the best accounting approach for your specific situation.",
