      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. and regarding the depreciation thing, if i decide to expense the whole thing this year (like under section 179), how do i actually log that in quickbooks so it doesn't mess up my profit/loss statements later? i just want to make sure i don't lose track of where the money went or have it disappear from my records.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
